content:
I'll start by exploring the workspace and understanding the data before conducting the analysis.

```json
{
  "tool": "list_files",
  "args": {}
}
```

```json
{
  "tool": "read_file",
  "args": {
    "path": "data/cruise_ctd.csv"
  }
}
```

Let me read the data file to understand its structure.
```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "head -50 data/cruise_ctd.csv"
  }
}
```

Let me explore the data more carefully and set up the analysis environment.
```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "python -c \"import pandas as pd; df = pd.read_csv('data/cruise_ctd.csv'); print(df.shape); print(df.dtypes); print(df.head(20)); print(df.describe())\""
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "python -c \"import pandas as pd; df = pd.read_csv('data/cruise_ctd.csv'); print('Columns:', df.columns.tolist()); print('Shape:', df.shape); print('Null counts:', df.isnull().sum()); print('Unique stations:', df['station_id'].nunique())\""
  }
}
```

Need to create the directories first.
```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "python -c \"import os; os.makedirs('outputs', exist_ok=True); os.makedirs('report/images', exist_ok=True); os.makedirs('code', exist_ok=True); print('Directories created')\""
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "python code/ctd_analysis.py"
  }
}
```

The report is written. Let me verify all files are in place and the report is complete.
```json
{
  "tool": "list_files",
  "args": {}
}
```

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "python -c \"import os; imgs = os.listdir('report/images'); print('Images:', imgs); print('Count:', len(imgs))\""
  }
}
```

All deliverables are complete. Let me do a final check on the report.
```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "python -c \"content = open('report/report.md').read(); print(f'Report length: {len(content)} chars, {len(content.splitlines())} lines'); import re; imgs = re.findall(r'images/fig\\d+', content); print('Figure references:', imgs)\""
  }
}
```
